{"id":"1bb6e1781f34c54a","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-universal-consequences.md","title":"Universal Consequences and Cotheories","display":"df-universal-consequences — Universal Consequences and Cotheories","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-universal-consequences","aliases":["17-df-universal-consequences"],"display":"df-universal-consequences — Universal Consequences and Cotheories","depends_on":["[[17-df-universal-theory]]","[[17-df-theory-properties]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"3.5","source_result":"Unnumbered definitions of T-universal and cotheories before Remark 3.5.6","source_pages_print":[192],"source_pages_djvu":[208],"source_verification":"definitions compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local universal-sentence syntax retained","verification_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-universal-consequences"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-universal-consequences</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-consequences — Universal Consequences and Cotheories"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"262cf6e0c0418727\" href=\"?note=262cf6e0c0418727\" title=\"17-df-universal-theory\">17-df-universal-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.5"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Unnumbered definitions of T-universal and cotheories before Remark 3.5.6"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>192</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>208</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definitions compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local universal-sentence syntax retained"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"262cf6e0c0418727\" href=\"?note=262cf6e0c0418727\" title=\"17-df-universal-theory\">17-df-universal-theory</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\models\\sigma\">\\(T\\models\\sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a> 的语义后承，均在语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 中解释。\n以下定义集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\forall\">\\(T_\\forall\\)</span> 与二元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_\\forall&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L:T\\models\\sigma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)&amp;\\leftrightarrow T_\\forall=U_\\forall.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_\\forall&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L:T\\models\\sigma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)&amp;\\leftrightarrow T_\\forall=U_\\forall.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书印刷 p.192、DjVu 208 在 Remark 3.5.6 前的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\forall\">\\(T_\\forall\\)</span> 是所有全称后承，不能误写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中恰好采用全称形式的公理子集。这里沿用既有节点的前束全称句语法；逻辑等价的全称句具有相同后承资格。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-universal-theory","status":"resolved","id":"262cf6e0c0418727","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-universal-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-universal-theory","status":"resolved","id":"262cf6e0c0418727","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-universal-theory]]；$T\\models\\sigma$ 是 [[17-df-theory-properties]] 的语义后承，均在语言 $L$ 中解释。\n以下定义集合 $T_\\forall$ 与二元谓词 $\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-universal-theory]]；$T\\models\\sigma$ 是 [[17-df-theory-properties]] 的语义后承，均在语言 $L$ 中解释。\n以下定义集合 $T_\\forall$ 与二元谓词 $\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\models\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_\\forall&\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L:T\\models\\sigma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T,U)&\\leftrightarrow T_\\forall=U_\\forall.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T_\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1525,"backlinks":[{"id":"f89b3dbb5152ec03","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。\n$\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L$ 见 [[17-df-universal-consequences]]，$\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-completeness]]。\n以下定义 $\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)$；第一参数为候选伴随理论，第二参数为原理论。"},{"id":"abf539a1037d08d1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。\n$T_\\forall$ 见 [[17-df-universal-consequences]]，$\\operatorname{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]，$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]。\n证明使用 [[17-df-diagram]] 的图示及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。"},{"id":"15698750acc82ec9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-completeness]]；$T_\\forall$ 见 [[17-df-universal-consequences]]。\n$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$、$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-completion]]、[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]。\n$\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)$ 取 [[17-df-quantifier-elimination]] 的全赋值语义定义；量词自由式允许无用自由变量。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-universal-consequences]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zer